OL,3,GNEWSADelayed discharges costing trust
OL,4,A#21.5m a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients stuck in hospital beds despite
OL,7,Fbeing medically fit to leave are
OL,8,Fcosting an NHS trust about #21.5m a
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FTees, Esk and Valleys NHS Foundation
OL,12,FTrust (TEWV), which covers mental
OL,13,Fhealth and learning disability services
OL,14,Fin areas including County Durham and
OL,15,FTeesside, said it had 68 adult patients
OL,16,Ftaking up bed spaces at the end of
OL,17,FAugust despite it not being clinically
OL,18,Fnecessary.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
