OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADelayed discharges costing trust
OL,4,A#21.5m a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FReasons for the issue included delays
OL,7,Fin moving people to external care
OL,8,Fplacements, it said in a report. The 68
OL,9,Fpatients made up about 18% of the
OL,10,Ftrust's total number of acute beds.
OL,12,FThe trust said it was seeking to curb
OL,13,Fthe problem by improving its community
OL,14,Fservices.
